---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---
<Layout title="Privacy Policy | Catonsville Garage Doors" description="Privacy policy for Catonsville Garage Doors website.">
  <section class="section" style="padding-top: 3rem;">
    <div class="container" style="max-width: 800px;">
      <h1>Privacy Policy</h1>
      <p style="margin-top: 1rem; color: var(--text-muted);">Last updated: October 2026</p>
      <p style="margin-top: 1.5rem;">Catonsville Garage Doors respects your privacy. This site may collect limited information when you contact us (such as name, phone, email, and service address) solely to respond to your inquiry and provide service.</p>
      <p style="margin-top: 1rem;">We do not sell your personal information. We may use standard analytics or hosting logs that collect non-identifying technical data (browser, IP, pages visited) to improve the site and diagnose issues.</p>
      <p style="margin-top: 1rem;">For questions about this policy, call (410) 247-4567 or contact us via the contact page.</p>
    </div>
  </section>
</Layout>
